    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65201" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰτᾴζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματάω</span>
			, <i>speak</i> or <i>work folly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				891
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλάγχνα δ᾽ οὔ τι
			ματᾴζει</span> my heart <i>is</i> not <i>deceived</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				995
			</span></i> (lyr.).—On the form cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.929
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				737.21
			</span></i>:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματαΐζω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				6.2.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματᾴζω</span> is prob. 
				contr.
			 fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ματαιΐζω</span>.)</div>
